# Local-only tests, kept out of the published repository by choice.
# CI runs `pytest -q`, so these do not run there; they are for local checks.
# Listed one by one rather than ignoring tests/ wholesale, so a new test file
# still shows up in `git status` and gets a deliberate decision.
